      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Fizz's attacks bleed his enemies, dealing magic damage over several seconds. Fizz can empower his next attack to deal bonus damage and empower his further attacks for a short time.",
      "summary_zh": "菲兹的攻击会让他的敌人们流血，同时造成持续数秒的魔法伤害。菲兹可以强化他的下次普攻来造成额外伤害，并在短时间内强化他的后续普攻。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
