      "summary_en": "Fizz hops into the air, landing gracefully upon his spear and becoming untargetable. From this position, Fizz can either slam the ground or choose to jump again before smashing back down.",
      "summary_zh": "菲兹跳到空中，同时优雅地落在他的长矛上，变得不可被选取。在这个姿态下，菲兹可以选择立原地着陆，也可以选择在着陆之前再跳一段距离。",
