      "summary_en": "Fizz tosses a fish in a direction that attaches to any champion that touches it, slowing the target. After a short delay, a shark erupts from the ground, knocking up the target and knocking any nearby enemies aside. All enemies hit are dealt magic damage and slowed.",
      "summary_zh": "菲兹朝一个方向放出一条小鱼，小鱼会附身在第一个与它接触的敌方英雄身上，同时减速目标。在短暂的延迟之后，一条巨鲨就会破土而出，击飞目标并将目标附近的敌人震开。被命中的所有敌人都会受到魔法伤害和减速效果。",
